{"id":"b5e158c134df5c1d","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-quantifier-free-projection.md","title":"无量词投影","display":"df-quantifier-free-projection — 无量词投影","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-quantifier-free-projection","aliases":["29-df-quantifier-free-projection"],"display":"df-quantifier-free-projection — 无量词投影","depends_on":["[[29-df-first-order-projection]]","[[29-df-atomic-formula]]","[[29-df-formula]]"],"source_locator":"Definition 11.7, pp.172–173, DjVu scans 187–188; Exercise 11.9","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本及扫描页187–188图像；定义已对照并修正序符号OCR，传递性练习未独立重证"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-quantifier-free-projection"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-quantifier-free-projection</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quantifier-free-projection — 无量词投影"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9e37f96b88bff2af\" href=\"?note=9e37f96b88bff2af\" title=\"29-df-first-order-projection\">29-df-first-order-projection</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"19d380b6c383f76b\" href=\"?note=19d380b6c383f76b\" title=\"29-df-atomic-formula\">29-df-atomic-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition 11.7, pp.172–173, DjVu scans 187–188; Exercise 11.9"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本及扫描页187–188图像；定义已对照并修正序符号OCR，传递性练习未独立重证"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu=\\langle{\\leq}^{(2)},\\mathrm{SUC}^{(2)},0,\\max\\rangle\">\\(\\nu=\\langle{\\leq}^{(2)},\\mathrm{SUC}^{(2)},0,\\max\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma=\\nu\\cup\\rho\">\\(\\sigma=\\nu\\cup\\rho\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N\">\\(\\mathfrak N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\">\\(\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"9e37f96b88bff2af\" href=\"?note=9e37f96b88bff2af\" title=\"29-df-first-order-projection\">29-df-first-order-projection</a>。</li>\n<li>对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N_n\">\\(N_n\\)</span> 与序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak N\">\\(\\mathfrak N\\)</span> 由下式固定，数值关系只取标准非严格序与标准后继，数值常量只取两个端点。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\)</span> 是有限关系词汇 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 上的原子公式与公式集合；下式对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S=\\nu,\\sigma\">\\(S=\\nu,\\sigma\\)</span> 分别定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QF}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{QF}_S\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Phi=(\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s)\">\\(\\Phi=(\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\">\\(\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为布尔查询。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FOPSpec}\">\\(\\mathrm{FOPSpec}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9e37f96b88bff2af\" href=\"?note=9e37f96b88bff2af\" title=\"29-df-first-order-projection\">29-df-first-order-projection</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFPSpec}\">\\(\\mathrm{QFPSpec}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFPQuery}\">\\(\\mathrm{QFPQuery}\\)</span> 与下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qfp}\">\\(\\mathrm{qfp}\\)</span> 标记下式引入的公式组集、查询集及归约关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\leq_{n}\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in n^2\\mid i\\leq j\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{SUC}_n\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in n^2\\mid j=i+1\\},\\qquad\nN_n\\coloneqq\\langle n,\\leq_{n},\\mathrm{SUC}_n,0,n-1\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathfrak N\\coloneqq(N_n)_{n\\geq1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\leq_{n}\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in n^2\\mid i\\leq j\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{SUC}_n\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in n^2\\mid j=i+1\\},\\qquad\nN_n\\coloneqq\\langle n,\\leq_{n},\\mathrm{SUC}_n,0,n-1\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathfrak N\\coloneqq(N_n)_{n\\geq1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QF}_S\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\ \\middle|\\\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\subseteq F\\land\n\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in F\\;\n\\left(\\neg\\phi\\in F\\land\n\\bigwedge_{\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}}\\bigl((\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\in F\\bigr)\\right)\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QF}_S\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\ \\middle|\\\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\subseteq F\\land\n\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in F\\;\n\\left(\\neg\\phi\\in F\\land\n\\bigwedge_{\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}}\\bigl((\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\in F\\bigr)\\right)\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFPSpec}_k[\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N]\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{FOPSpec}_k[\\nu,\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N]\\mid\n\\{\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{QF}_\\sigma\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QFPSpec}_k[\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N]\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{FOPSpec}_k[\\nu,\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N]\\mid\n\\{\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{QF}_\\sigma\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QFPQuery}_k[\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E]\\coloneqq\n\\{I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}}\\mid\n\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{QFPSpec}_k[\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N]\n\\land I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}}[\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}]\n\\subseteq\\mathcal E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{QFPQuery}_k[\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E]\\coloneqq\n\\{I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}}\\mid\n\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{QFPSpec}_k[\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N]\n\\land I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}}[\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}]\n\\subseteq\\mathcal E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S\\leq_{\\mathrm{qfp}}^{\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E}\\mathcal T\\\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists I\\in\\mathrm{QFPQuery}_k[\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E]\\;\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\\;(A\\in\\mathcal S\\leftrightarrow I(A)\\in\\mathcal T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S\\leq_{\\mathrm{qfp}}^{\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E}\\mathcal T\\\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists I\\in\\mathrm{QFPQuery}_k[\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E]\\;\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\\;(A\\in\\mathcal S\\leftrightarrow I(A)\\in\\mathcal T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition 11.7，印刷页172–173、扫描页187–188。qfp 除继承 fop 的单输入文字与互斥数值守卫条件外，域、关系及常量见证公式都必须无量词。原书在此限制数值关系为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SUC}\">\\(\\mathrm{SUC}\\)</span>，以保证其传递性；端点是固定数值常量。扫描页188图像确认是非严格序 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\leq\">\\(\\leq\\)</span>，隐藏文本层识别为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\">\\(&lt;\\)</span>，此处以图像为准。本条没有把 Exercise 11.9 的传递性结论当作已独立证明。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QF}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{QF}_S\\)</span> 是原子公式对布尔构造的最小闭包，不含个体量化，故不会用“公式可等价改写为无量词”偷换语法条件。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-first-order-projection","status":"resolved","id":"9e37f96b88bff2af","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-first-order-projection]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-atomic-formula","status":"resolved","id":"19d380b6c383f76b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-atomic-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-first-order-projection","status":"resolved","id":"9e37f96b88bff2af","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\nu=\\langle{\\leq}^{(2)},\\mathrm{SUC}^{(2)},0,\\max\\rangle$，$\\rho$、$\\sigma=\\nu\\cup\\rho$、$\\tau$、$\\mathfrak N$、$\\mathcal E$ 和 $\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}$ 沿用 [[29-df-first-order-projection]]。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-first-order-projection","status":"resolved","id":"9e37f96b88bff2af","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FOPSpec}$ 见 [[29-df-first-order-projection]]；$\\mathrm{QFPSpec}$、$\\mathrm{QFPQuery}$ 与下标 $\\mathrm{qfp}$ 标记下式引入的公式组集、查询集及归约关系。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\nu=\\langle{\\leq}^{(2)},\\mathrm{SUC}^{(2)},0,\\max\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma=\\nu\\cup\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"N_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AtFml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_S","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"S=\\nu,\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QF}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\Phi=(\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\subseteq\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T\\subseteq\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FOPSpec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QFPSpec}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QFPQuery}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{qfp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq_{n}\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in n^2\\mid i\\leq j\\},\\qquad\n\\mathrm{SUC}_n\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in n^2\\mid j=i+1\\},\\qquad\nN_n\\coloneqq\\langle n,\\leq_{n},\\mathrm{SUC}_n,0,n-1\\rangle,\\qquad\n\\mathfrak N\\coloneqq(N_n)_{n\\geq1}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QF}_S\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\left\\{F\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\ \\middle|\\\n\\mathrm{AtFml}_S\\subseteq F\\land\n\\forall\\phi,\\psi\\in F\\;\n\\left(\\neg\\phi\\in F\\land\n\\bigwedge_{\\circ\\in\\{\\land,\\lor,\\to,\\leftrightarrow\\}}\\bigl((\\phi\\circ\\psi)\\in F\\bigr)\\right)\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QFPSpec}_k[\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N]\\coloneqq\n\\{\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{FOPSpec}_k[\\nu,\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N]\\mid\n\\{\\varphi_0,\\ldots,\\varphi_r,\\psi_1,\\ldots,\\psi_s\\}\\subseteq\\mathrm{QF}_\\sigma\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QFPQuery}_k[\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E]\\coloneqq\n\\{I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}}\\mid\n\\Phi\\in\\mathrm{QFPSpec}_k[\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N]\n\\land I_\\Phi^{\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}}[\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}]\n\\subseteq\\mathcal E\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal S\\leq_{\\mathrm{qfp}}^{\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E}\\mathcal T\\\n\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\exists k\\geq1\\;\\exists I\\in\\mathrm{QFPQuery}_k[\\rho,\\tau;\\mathfrak N,\\mathcal E]\\;\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal D_{\\mathfrak N,\\rho}\\;(A\\in\\mathcal S\\leftrightarrow I(A)\\in\\mathcal T).","display":true},{"tex":"\\leq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SUC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\leq","display":false},{"tex":"<","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QF}_S","display":false}],"bytes":3403,"backlinks":[{"id":"ca9dcc9ec1866c06","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"范式性质说每个含任意嵌套调用的可定义查询，都能写成一次 $Q_S(I)$，其中 $I$ 的公式不含 $Q_S$。把这种性质写成模型类等价，避免误要求语法树逐字等于单调用节点。fo/fop/qfp分别约束 $I$ 的允许类型；合法性、数值背景与目标域不能在命题中省去。投影定义可查 [[29-df-first-order-projection]] 和 [[29-df-quantifier-free-projection]]，此处只有选用该特例时才使用它们。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-123","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-projection]]、[[29-df-first-order-projection]]、[[29-df-quantifier-free-projection]] — 非一致投影、fop、qfp"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-quantifier-free-projection]]"}],"outgoing":["9e37f96b88bff2af","19d380b6c383f76b","a3fa1d78e657e6a2"]}